category: Security
requires: cygwin libssl3
sdesc: "Library that implements RFC 7030 (Enrollment over Secure Transport) (runtime)"
ldesc: "This project is a library that implements RFC 7030 (Enrollment over Secure
Transport). EST is used to provision certificates from a CA or RA. EST is a
replacement for SCEP, providing several security enhancements and support for
ECC certificates."
external-source: libest

